[DummyUsage]
Dummy0001=0
Dummy0002=1
Dummy0003=1
Dummy0004=1
Dummy0005=1
Dummy0006=1
Dummy0007=1

[Comments]
Lines=6
Line1=Velocity unit: 0.1 rpm at the wheel (output shaft), positive = forward.
Line2=Acceleration unit: velocity units per second.
Line3=Position: 6063h is raw quadrature counts, 6064h is milli-revolutions.
Line4=Only Profile Velocity mode (6060h = 3) is supported; 6502h reports it.
Line5=2101h is the firmware image; download it with SDO block transfer and
Line6=drive the sequence through 2100h:03. See docs/fota.md.

